## Case text (ck.db zephyr_cases key AWPTCM-T17584, tools/ckcase.py on tb101, 2026-10-21 12:5x)
Title: LACP - Startup stable with heavy traffic
Folder: /VCS (Virtual Chassis Stacking)/VCS (VMAC)/VMAC - L2 Features ; labels Stress, Platform-Test ; status Approved
Objective: "Conduct several topology changes and check that port interfaces configured of LACP handles heavy
traffic and still uses the virtual-mac of the stack."
Steps (one row, verbatim steps_text): "1. Configure as shown in the Setup/Configs 2. Start traffic into all 4
devices destined for opposite pair e.g. Left<->right/top<->bottom. 3. Conducted multiple port down events so
that topology had to change totally 4. reboot stack 5. Check traffic and MAC tables of Stack"
Expected (verbatim): "Traffic should be flowing without a problem The MAC tables should reflect the correct MAC
addresses"
The Setup/Configs referred to in step 1 are NOT in ck.db (steps raw column 424 chars, no config block).

